    <div>This document presents the complete 3D multi-tier architectural specification and full technology stack for <strong>MediCore OS</strong> &mdash; a high-availability Hospital Operating and Clinical Intelligence System. Includes high-resolution 3D isometric layer visualization, 20 relational database schemas in PostgreSQL 16, security RBAC specifications, and clinical telemetry engines.</div>
